# `$F5` repeating to a point no `$F4` set: song $18 (subCaves3_noIntro).
# The wave channel's first `$F4` follows a length byte, so it plays as a
# note, reading past musicNotes into the tempo tables. At tick 217 its `$F5`
# returns to the $0000 left by initializeAudio, and the Game Boy reads its
# own ROM there as song data. Five seconds.
[songRequest=18]
